{% comment %}
  The clinic badge shown at the top of the booking popup (mobile step header)
  and as the desktop "Selected Clinic" pill in each step's left column. It
  shows the current clinic name (In-Clinic) or "Online Consultation" (Video
  Consult), swapped by setOnlineHeaderState() in kal-booking-flow.js, which
  drives it off the shared .kal-step-header__location-text class and the
  data-kal-location-icon-offline/-online pair.

  Two looks, chosen by the single line "assign clinic_switcher = false" below
  (there is no theme-editor setting for it):

  - false (the current state): a plain, non-interactive label.
  - true: the same badge becomes a button with a down arrow. Clicking it opens a
    list of the clinics (the Clinic entries, shop.metaobjects.clinic) and
    choosing one switches the booking to that clinic, with a "switch clinic?"
    popup when the chosen doctor is not offered in person there. All of that is
    already in the theme: the markup below, the click handling in
    kal-booking-flow.js (FACILITY SWITCHER), the popup in
    kal-booking-flow.liquid and the styling in kal-booking-flow.css. To attach
    the dropdown later, change that one line to true. The switcher only appears
    on steps 1 to 3 (or where no step_number is given, the mobile header),
    because after that a doctor and a time are already chosen.

  Accepts:
  - step_number: {Number} which step this copy is on; the switcher is only
    offered on steps 1-3.
  - location_text: {String} clinic name shown in the badge, defaults to
    "Indiranagar" (a placeholder until the real clinic is applied).
  - extra_class: {String} optional, appended to the outer .kal-facility-picker
    wrapper for context-specific styling (e.g. Concern Select's desktop pill look).

  Usage:
  {% render 'kal-booking-flow-facility-picker', step_number: 1, location_text: 'Indiranagar' %}
{% endcomment %}

{%- liquid
  assign location_text = location_text | default: 'Indiranagar'
  assign clinic_switcher = false
  assign switchable = false
  if clinic_switcher
    if step_number == blank or step_number <= 3
      assign switchable = true
    endif
  endif
-%}

{%- if switchable -%}
<div class="kal-facility-picker{% if extra_class %} {{ extra_class }}{% endif %}" data-kal-facility-picker>
  <button
    type="button"
    class="kal-step-header__location-badge"
    data-kal-facility-toggle
    aria-haspopup="listbox"
    aria-expanded="false"
  >
    <span class="kal-step-header__location-badge-left">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
        <span data-kal-location-icon-offline>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}</span>
        <span data-kal-location-icon-online hidden>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'mode-online' -%}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-header__location-text">{{ location_text }}</span>
      <span class="kal-step-header__location-chevron" aria-hidden="true">
        {%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'chevron-down' -%}
      </span>
    </span>
  </button>
  <ul class="kal-country-picker__panel" data-kal-facility-panel hidden role="listbox" aria-label="Choose a clinic">
    {%- for clinic in shop.metaobjects.clinic.values -%}
      {%- if clinic.facility_id.value != blank and clinic.name.value != blank -%}
    <li role="presentation">
      <button type="button" class="kal-country-picker__option kal-facility-picker__option" data-kal-facility-option data-kal-facility-option-id="{{ clinic.facility_id.value | escape }}" data-kal-facility-name="{{ clinic.name.value | escape }}" role="option" aria-selected="false">
        <span class="kal-country-picker__label">{{ clinic.name.value | escape }}</span>
        <span class="kal-facility-picker__check">{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'check' -%}</span>
      </button>
    </li>
      {%- endif -%}
    {%- endfor -%}
  </ul>
</div>
{%- else -%}
<div class="kal-facility-picker{% if extra_class %} {{ extra_class }}{% endif %}">
  <div class="kal-step-header__location-badge">
    <span class="kal-step-header__location-badge-left">
      <span class="kal-icon kal-icon--location">
        <span data-kal-location-icon-offline>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'location-pin' -%}</span>
        <span data-kal-location-icon-online hidden>{%- render 'kal-booking-icons', icon_name: 'mode-online' -%}</span>
      </span>
      <span class="kal-step-header__location-text">{{ location_text }}</span>
    </span>
  </div>
</div>
{%- endif -%}
